SELECT v.id, c.id, $t$Best Tonneau Covers for 2019–2025 Chevy Silverado 1500 (5'8" / 6'6" / 8 ft)$t$, $m$Tonneau covers verified for the T1 Silverado 1500 by bed length, including Multi-Flex tailgate and Durabed rail notes.$m$, $i$The T1 Silverado has three beds: 5'8" short (70 in), 6'6" standard (79 in) and 8 ft long (98 in). The short bed is on every Crew Cab and is where most cover stock sits. Matching your bed length is the only spec that matters more than cover type.$i$, $g$- **Multi-Flex tailgate (2021+)** has an inner gate that swings inside the cover's tailgate seal — most covers fit but a handful of low-profile hard covers block the inner-gate release.
- **Durabed corner steps** and **cargo tie-downs** are below the rail and do not interfere.
- **2019 LD / Limited** (old-body-style trucks sold as 2019s) use the previous-gen bed — check the VIN body style before ordering.
- **ZR2 / Trail Boss** share the short bed; no fit difference.$g$, $f$[{"q": "Which Silverado bed do I have?", "a": "Crew Cab = 5'8\" (70 in) unless ordered with the 6'6\" bed; Double Cab = 6'6\"; Regular Cab = 8 ft. Measure inside the bed to confirm."}, {"q": "Do covers work with the Multi-Flex tailgate?", "a": "Yes for roll-ups and most tri-folds. Look for 'Multi-Flex compatible' if you use the inner gate as a step."}, {"q": "Do Silverado and Sierra covers interchange?", "a": "Yes — same bed unless the Sierra has the CarbonPro composite bed, which needs a CarbonPro-specific cover."}]$f$::jsonb, $v$**Budget:** soft tri-fold. **Best overall:** hard tri-fold with a Multi-Flex-compatible tailgate seal. **Premium:** electric retractable.$v$, 'draft', CURRENT_DATE
FROM vehicles v JOIN makes m ON m.id=v.make_id JOIN categories c ON c.slug='tonneau-covers'
