- **Denali Ultimate** ships with CarbonPro standard on some model years — check the build sheet.$g$, $f$[{"q": "How do I know if I have the CarbonPro bed?", "a": "Bed floor is dark carbon composite with a molded pattern, not spray-in liner over steel. It is listed on the window sticker as CarbonPro."}, {"q": "Do Silverado covers fit the Sierra?", "a": "Yes for steel beds. Not for CarbonPro."}, {"q": "Which covers keep the MultiPro step usable?", "a": "Roll-ups and soft tri-folds. Hard covers must be folded first to use the inner gate."}]$f$::jsonb, $v$**Steel bed:** hard tri-fold. **CarbonPro:** the few CarbonPro-listed roll-ups — expect to pay more. **Premium:** retractable, steel beds only.$v$, 'draft', CURRENT_DATE
