- **Trailhunter** has a factory ARB-designed rack — buy accessories for it, not a second rack.
- **Roof load rating**: confirm in your owner's manual before a tent; early listings vary.
- **Hybrid (i-FORCE MAX)** has no roof-fit difference.$g$, $f$[{"q": "Can I reuse my old 4Runner crossbars?", "a": "No. Rail spacing and profile changed."}, {"q": "Which trims have raised rails?", "a": "All except Trailhunter (factory rack); verify on your build sheet."}, {"q": "Is stock limited?", "a": "Yes in 2026 — we list only confirmed fitments and update monthly."}]$f$::jsonb, $v$**Budget:** raised-rail crossbars listed for 2025+. **Best overall:** low-profile platform with 2025+ fit. **Trailhunter:** accessories for the factory rack.$v$, 'draft', CURRENT_DATE
