- **X-Pro / X-Line** share the rails.
- **Panoramic sunroof** — keep the front bar behind the tilt line.$g$, $f$[{"q": "Do I need Kia crossbars?", "a": "No — aftermarket raised-rail clamp bars fit and are usually stiffer."}, {"q": "Biggest box the Telluride can take?", "a": "Up to ~22 cu ft with a 220 lb roof load; watch total weight with contents."}, {"q": "Palisade the same?", "a": "Yes for the roof; Palisade boxes and bars interchange."}]$f$::jsonb, $v$**Budget:** 14 cu ft + clamp bars. **Best overall:** 18 cu ft low-profile. **Family road trips:** 21–22 cu ft.$v$, 'draft', CURRENT_DATE
