- **7-seat** needs a third-row set and a different trunk floor mat.
- **Frunk liner** is worth it — it takes wet gear.
- **Trunk well liner** must match the sub-trunk depth (changed on Juniper).$g$, $f$[{"q": "Do Model 3 mats fit the Model Y?", "a": "Front mats, no; some sellers cross-list but the shape differs."}, {"q": "What's in a full set?", "a": "Front, rear, trunk floor, trunk well, frunk — five pieces; seven with third row."}, {"q": "Are Tesla OEM mats better?", "a": "Similar quality to top laser-fit brands at roughly double the price."}]$f$::jsonb, $v$**Budget:** 3-piece cabin set. **Best overall:** 5-piece laser-fit set for your year. **7-seat:** 7-piece set listed for your year.$v$, 'draft', CURRENT_DATE
